<http://data.silknow.org/object/c344b860-c656-3203-8526-49aefc013719>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Eastern Orthodox Church. The Virgin Mary seated on a sepulchur holds the body of Jesus in her arms. She is flanked by four cherubim and a pair of angels holding large candlesticks. The cross, with a greek inscription above it describing the scene, rises behind her. Border of a stylized leafy and flowering undulation vine with square compartments in each cornerbearing the symbols of the four Evangelists. Pieced outer border of ellow silk with two tassels possibly a later addition. Polychrome silk and metallic yarns on a red satin-silk ground. Many yarns missing. Outer border soiled."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/d759d778-8b8a-3684-8ea8-1ea7b5b02a45> ;
